// # website/docs — Package Manual
//
// Logline: RFC-0005 docs for the website repo. The public pages
//          live in pulled/. Each page cites a sibling docs/.
//
// Setup: No caps. Default route home cites
//        openOODA/.github/docs/. Product routes cite
//        openOODA/<repo>/docs/. Do not cite a repo root.
//
// Beats:
//   1. pulled/home.oot Source: openOODA/.github/docs/.
//   2. Product pulled/*.oot Source: openOODA/<repo>/docs/.
//   3. website and .github have no sidebar route. Brand is
//      home.
